{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dinner invitation turns into a deadly game of wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you arrive at a mysterious manor for an elegant meal, the doors lock behind you. Guests turn to statues, voices whisper through the walls, and the host\u2019s motives grow more sinister with every course. You\u2019re not here to eat\u2026 you\u2019re here to solve your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Cinematic Escape-Room Puzzles \u2013 Each handcrafted challenge ties into the mystery, from cryptic logic problems to mechanical contraptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfac Movie-Style Storytelling \u2013 Fully integrated cinematics reveal characters, motives, and hidden clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Interconnected Clues \u2013 Every puzzle is part of a bigger web; solutions hint at the truth behind the dinner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf17 Evolving Atmosphere \u2013 Shift from warm candlelit curiosity to tense, shadow-filled uncertainty as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Immersive Audio &amp; Feedback \u2013 Custom voice acting, ambient soundscapes, and visual cues reward your every breakthrough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the truth before the final course is served? Or will you become part of the manor\u2019s collection?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Square Filler.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3115860/72743bfff1589db3dbd587e846011cd14cb56afd.jpg"},{"name":"Open gates.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/imag